    {
      "evidence_id": "ev-f597b9a340c8205bdaec9e3b",
      "path_or_url": "reservoir.md",
      "section": "Reservoir station",
      "snippet": "# Reservoir station\n\nThese procedures apply to the unmanned reservoir station during winter operation.\n\n",
      "version_binding": "unversioned",
      "content_sha256": "72e1b44e3b95c794a6680eca333839f8db6656e036242d6dbad8f29b005746b6",
      "project_identity": "local:fa2c03151dd5362cb3fcf7eb3037b5ff95d9db79a25257d9cccab51206927910",
      "line_start": 1,
      "line_end": 4,
      "authority": "source_of_truth",
      "scope": "project",
      "source_uri": "docatlas://source/v2/4850238d6fc9b284795ec625"
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "ev-e40f6271cb0204546f83513b",
      "path_or_url": "reservoir.md",
      "section": "Reservoir station > Restart",
      "snippet": "## Restart\n\nRestart the circulation pump only after the inlet sensor reads at least four degrees Celsius. Record the sensor reading in the shift ledger before pressing START.\n\n",
      "version_binding": "unversioned",
      "content_sha256": "f74f4b8a8b5efa9f7962d27a1f8e4cac73fc07efe73e4c8d09568beef93025b4",
      "project_identity": "local:fa2c03151dd5362cb3fcf7eb3037b5ff95d9db79a25257d9cccab51206927910",
      "line_start": 5,
      "line_end": 8,
      "authority": "source_of_truth",
      "scope": "project",
      "source_uri": "docatlas://source/v2/427929d96fce9252fcf28ec8"
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "ev-4f1c500bcc5e0847c8719b0d",
      "path_or_url": "reservoir.md",
      "section": "Reservoir station > Restart > Inspection",
      "snippet": "### Inspection\n\nBefore restart, inspect the intake grille and remove accumulated leaves. A cracked grille requires replacement before the pump may run.\n\n",
      "version_binding": "unversioned",
      "content_sha256": "5555665ea7b901c9c21f2029a0e595a48e0c3cc519e085297ef2aca84ce16706",
      "project_identity": "local:fa2c03151dd5362cb3fcf7eb3037b5ff95d9db79a25257d9cccab51206927910",
      "line_start": 9,
      "line_end": 12,
      "authority": "source_of_truth",
      "scope": "project",
      "source_uri": "docatlas://source/v2/6c27338b53b5cd422ed6d7f5"
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "ev-4c9eece8c7c03d5272568b12",
      "path_or_url": "reservoir.md",
      "section": "Reservoir station > Restart > Indicator lamps",
      "snippet": "### Indicator lamps\n\nThe amber cabinet lamp indicates that the maintenance drawer is open. Closing the drawer extinguishes this lamp; the lamp does not measure inlet temperature.\n\n",
      "version_binding": "unversioned",
      "content_sha256": "944b68c6c8f693206778a999409ffa2901d1f59486c74fc351be35df4e86ca22",
      "project_identity": "local:fa2c03151dd5362cb3fcf7eb3037b5ff95d9db79a25257d9cccab51206927910",
      "line_start": 13,
      "line_end": 16,
      "authority": "source_of_truth",
      "scope": "project",
      "source_uri": "docatlas://source/v2/1db4ec10c9b2b772289b3e5e"
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "ev-fcb28837ca78bbd18764d65e",
      "path_or_url": "reservoir.md",
      "section": "Reservoir station > Frozen intake",
      "snippet": "## Frozen intake\n\nWhen ice remains visible inside the intake, restarting the circulation pump is prohibited even if the inlet sensor reads four degrees Celsius or more. Request a manual thaw inspection instead.\n\n",
      "version_binding": "unversioned",
      "content_sha256": "124e2d8bcb7ea80e5f607ec6d40aad596dbd084bebcb3dd682f5e10de7822d1c",
      "project_identity": "local:fa2c03151dd5362cb3fcf7eb3037b5ff95d9db79a25257d9cccab51206927910",
      "line_start": 17,
      "line_end": 20,
      "authority": "source_of_truth",
      "scope": "project",
      "source_uri": "docatlas://source/v2/93a8ad390c4f1a9ecd26a43d"
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "ev-65b075b8745ce235accd3230",
      "path_or_url": "reservoir.md",
      "section": "Reservoir station > Ledger storage",
      "snippet": "## Ledger storage\n\nCompleted shift ledgers are archived in the west cabinet for nine months. The cabinet key is held by the records clerk.\n\n",
      "version_binding": "unversioned",
      "content_sha256": "ceba1d345b922a000cb6657cc1bdb7ca7ab4f4d988d422ebd51bd63f1e85c48d",
      "project_identity": "local:fa2c03151dd5362cb3fcf7eb3037b5ff95d9db79a25257d9cccab51206927910",
      "line_start": 21,
      "line_end": 24,
      "authority": "source_of_truth",
      "scope": "project",
      "source_uri": "docatlas://source/v2/ec2b23f8a7606d8acd537e0f"
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "ev-e8f44864988ed30b0bac081a",
      "path_or_url": "reservoir.md",
      "section": "Reservoir station > Cabinet finish",
      "snippet": "## Cabinet finish\n\nThe exterior cabinet is painted slate blue. Replacement paint tins are stored with the building supplies.\n",
      "version_binding": "unversioned",
      "content_sha256": "8ddb7bb10ef03cc536893546ed1e96358072dbf78e3795b7e68408df2e42645c",
      "project_identity": "local:fa2c03151dd5362cb3fcf7eb3037b5ff95d9db79a25257d9cccab51206927910",
